      "side": 1,
      "message": "The bug that caused the revert last time is apparently an issue with SwiftShader. I\u0027ve checked for that and made it activate the same toggle as Qualcomm, so this should be working now.\n\nStill want to try a potentially more reliable way of constructing the framebuffer query that I discussed with Loko in the hopes that it could clear up the Qualcomm issue, but perhaps that\u0027s best left to another CL since there\u0027s no guarantee it\u0027ll work.",
      "revId": "9161f1e21d4fc6596972b2076ebcec20fa8f66f8",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "12ebace1_b0070255",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/Toggles.cpp",
